  _displayName: Black Marsh
  _regionName: Drowned Lowlands
  _briefing: 'South of the shelf the ice melts into a marsh that never dries. The roads are causeways between the pools, the trees are dead, and the mire itself breathes: leeches, slugs and bats come up out of it.'
